flowchart TD
    START([Start]) --> A[Investigator selects evidence to verify]
    A --> B[Authenticate user and check verification permission]
    B --> C{Authorized?}
    C -- No --> D[Record denied verification attempt]
    D --> END([End])
    C -- Yes --> E[Load trusted hash, signature and metadata]
    E --> F[Retrieve encrypted evidence object]
    F --> G{Object retrieved?}
    G -- No --> H[Record retrieval failure]
    H --> END
    G -- Yes --> I[Retrieve wrapped key reference]
    I --> J[Unwrap AES key]
    J --> K[Decrypt evidence in controlled workspace]
    K --> L[Calculate current SHA-256 hash]
    L --> M[Validate digital signature]
    M --> N{Signature valid?}
    N -- No --> O[Mark authenticity check failed]
    O --> P[Raise security incident]
    P --> Q[Append custody and audit records]
    Q --> END
    N -- Yes --> R{Hash matches trusted original?}
    R -- No --> S[Mark evidence integrity compromised]
    S --> P
    R -- Yes --> T[Mark evidence verified]
    T --> U[Create verification result with verifier and timestamp]
    U --> V[Persist result]
    V --> W[Append chain-of-custody verification event]
    W --> X[Write immutable verification audit record]
    X --> Y[Display verification report]
    Y --> END
